      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Just four line up. Going with THICKSKINNED (3) who made late ground to get up for second when fresh from a spell over 1150m at the Devonport Synthetic last start. Has trialled well since that return. Nicely placed out to 1400m and from the inside alley he looks the goods. BELLSPROUT (4) led from the outset for a convincing first-up victory over 1350m at Devonport Synthetic a month ago. Kept up to the mark with a couple of subsequent trial wins. Veteran sprinter who looks to be going as well as ever. ALPINE FURY (1) came with a well-timed run to salute first-up over this course and distance recently. The winner of two from two when second-up so the good form should hold. SNOW EAGLE (6) can run a big race first-up from a spell.",
